{
  "id": "JHN.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 6",
  "verseCount": 71,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo kabyahoire, Yesu ashabuka Enyanja ya Galilaya, niyo Nyanja ya Tiberia, agya buseli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embaga emuhondera, ahakuba bakabona ebitangazo ebyo yabaire yakoleire abarwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atemba aha ibanga ashuntama n'abegesibwabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ekiro kikuru ky'Abayahudi, niyo Pasika, kikaba kiraliire kugoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayaimukize amaisho akabona embaga emuhondeire, abaza Filipo ati, “Tugure nkahai ebyakulya eby'okuliisa abantu aba bona?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo akakigamba kumulenga, kuba wenene hakaba namanya eky'arakora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filipo amuhorora ati, “Emikate y'edinairi bikumi bibili telikubamara, n'orwo buli muntu yakulyaho kake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoiho omu begesibwabe, n'iwe Anderea murumuna Simoni Petero, amugambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha haliho omwana ainaho emikate etanu y'eshayiri n'enfuru ibili. Kyonkai ebyo bigasheki aha bantu bangi bati?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abaragira kushuntamya abantu. Honene aho hakaba haliho obunyasi bungi. Kityo abashaija bashuntama, orubara nka 5,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akwata emikate etanu. Kayamazire kusiima agigabira ababaire bashuntamire. N'enfuru kwakwo balya okwo balikwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire baliire baigusire, Yesu agambira ebegesibwabe ati, “Mushombokye obuchwagulika obwasigaraho, hatagira kaburaho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashombokya ebichwagulika ebyashaga aha mikate etanu ebyasigirweho ababaire baliire, baijuza entukuru 12. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo abantu baboine ekitangazo ekyo yakora, bagamba bati, “Ogu murangikwo owo ensi etura etegeleize!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amanyiramu okwo balikwenda kumukwata rwamani kumuteka aha ngoma, aho ashuba akwata omuhanda aruga aha ibanga ali wenkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eizoba kalyatobeire, abegesibwa ba Yesu bagya aha nyanja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bataha omu bwato, babanza kushabuka enyanja egyo bagiire Kaperinaumu. Litobera Yesu athakabagobire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuyaga gwihya n'amani, enyanja echundaiguka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire babugire obwato emaili nka inai babona Yesu natambuka aha maizi mara yaija kugoba obwato. Batina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kyonkai wenene abagambira ati, “N'inye, mutatina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashemelerwa kumutahya omu bwato, niho honkai obwato busoka aha mwaro mbali babaire bolekeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabwakeire, abantu ababaire basigaire buseli bw'enyanja, baijuka okwo habaire haliho obwato bumoi bwonkai, n'okwo Yesu atagenzire na begesibwabe; abegesibwa bakaba bagenzire bonkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amato agandi garuga Tiberia, gagoba bwatana mbali babaire baliliire ekyakulya orwo Omukama yamazire kusiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo abantu kabamazire kubona okwo Yesu atakiliho n'abegesibwabe, na bonene bataha omu mato ago, bagya Kaperinaumu nibamuhiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo bamushangire buseli bw'enyanja bamubaza bati, “Rabi, kunu oizireyo maki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagarukamu ati, “Nimbagambira amazima, timulikumpiiga aha rw'okuba muboine bubonero, nimupiga kuba muliire emikate mwaiguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalihendekera byakulya ebilikuhwaho, muhendekere ebyakulya ebitahwaho eby'okubagobya aha burora obutalihwaho obw'Omwana w'Omuntu alibaha; enshonga ishe akamutaho akamanyiso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamubaza bati, “Nituragirwa kukoraki, tukabona kukora emilimo ya Ruhanga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abashubamu ati, “Ogu nigwo mulimo gwa Ruhanga, inywe mwikilize ogwo owo yatumire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo bamubaza bati, “Mbwenu nokora kitangazoki ekyo twakubona tukaikiliza? Okora mulimoki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batat'enkurw'ichwe bakalya manu omw'irungu; nk'okwo kyakahandikirwe kiti, ‘Hakabaha ekyakulya ekyarugire omw'iguru.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “Nimbagambira amazima nti, Musa tiwe yabahaire kyakulya kya mw'iguru. Tata n'iwe abaha ekyakulya nyhakabara ekiruga omw'iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'enshonga ekyakulya kya Ruhanga nikyo kiruga omw'iguru kikaha ensi oburora.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamushaba bati, “Rugaba, waitu singa oikare notutunga ekyakulya ekyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “N'inye kyakulya ky'oburora. Alikaija ahali inye taligira njara; n'alikanyesiga talikwatwa iliho nakake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nabagambiire okwo mwamboine kyonkai timulikunyikiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona abo Tata ampa balija ahali inye; mara alikaija ahali inye tindimubinga n'akake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba tinairugire mw'iguru kukora byo inye ndikwenda, shana kukora ebyo ayantumire ayenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara eky'ayantumire ayenda niky'eki, ngu ahali bona abo yampaire hataliburwaho n'omoi, mbahimbure aha kiro ky'enzindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo Tata ayenda niky'eki: Buli omoi alikubona Mwana akamwikiliza abone oburora obutalihwaho, kandi nanye ndimuhimbura aha kiro ky'enzindo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abayahudi bamujurujwitira orwo yagambire ati, “N'inye kyakulya ekyarugire omw'iguru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bati, “Ogu ti Yesu mutabani wa Yozefu? Ishe na nyina nitubamanya! Mbwenu nashobora atai kugamba ati, ‘Nkaruga omw'iguru?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abahorora ati, “Muleke kujurujwitira omu matama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taliho alikushobora kwija ahali inye, Tata ayantumire atamwiliize haihi. Kandi nanye ndimuhimbura aha kiro ky'enzindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu barangi kikahandikwa okwo bona barayegesibwaga Ruhanga. Buli muntu ahulira ebya Tata akabimanya, aija ahali inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutagira muti haliho araboine Tata, shana ayarugire ahali Ruhanga, n'iwe aramuboine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbagambira amazima nti, alikwikiliza ogwo aina oburora obutalihwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'inye mukate gw'oburora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashwenkurw'inywe kabaliire manu omw'irungu bakafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazima ogu nigwo mukate ogwarugire omw'iguru, ogwo omuntu alilyaho, atafire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'inye kyakulya ky'oburora ekyarugire omw'iguru. Buli muntu alilyaho ekyakulya eki alirora eirai lyona. Kandi ekyakulya ekyo ndikwija kuha ensi k'egira oburora bwange nigwo mubili gwange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abayahudi bahakana bonene bonkai bati, “Omushaija ogu nashobora atai kutuliisa omubiligwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abagambira ati, “Nimbagambira amazima, kamuliba mutaliire mubili gw'Omwana w'Omuntu, kandi mutanyoire bwambabwe, timulirora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alikalya omubili gwange, akanywa n'obwamba bwange, ogwo aligira oburora obutalihwaho, kandi ndimuhimbura aha kiro ky'enzindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubili gwange kyakulya nyhakabara, n'obwamba bwange ky'okunywa nyhakabara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilya omubili gwange akanywa n'obwamba bwange aliikara omuli inye, nanye ndiikara omuli wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo Tata asingiire yantumire, nanye okwo nsingiire aha rwa Tata, nikwo n'alikandya aliba murora aha rwange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nigwo mukate ogwarugire omw'iguru, ogutali gwo bashw'enkurw'inywe baliire bakafa; alikalya omukate ogu alirora ebiro byona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigambo ebyo akabigambira omu sinagogi ya Kaperinaumu nayegesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu begesibwabe abali bangi kabahuliire ekyo bagamba bati, “Ekigambo eki kyasikiira, alikishobora n'ohai?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu kayamanyire okwo abegesibwabe bayeboroboita aha kigambo ekyo, yabaza ati, “Eki mwakyanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho biliba bitai kamulibona Omwana w'Omuntu natemba mbali yaturaga orwa mbere? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyo nigwo gugiza oburora. Omubili tigugira mugasho. Ebigambo ebyo nabagambira nigwo mwoyo mara burora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omuli inywe halimu abatalikwikiliza.” Kwema akarai kona Yesu hakaba namanya abatalikumwikiliza n'ayabaire naija kumubanja hakaba namumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo kugamba ati, “Nikyo nabagambilira okwo taliho yakushobora kwija ahali inye Tata atamulesire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.65"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwema aho omu begesibwabe abali bangi befunya, baba batakigenda nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Yesu kubaza eikumi na babili ati, “Nainywe nimwenda kwegendera?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.67"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "68",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:68"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "68",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoni Petero amuhorora ati, “Rugaba, waitu tugye ahali ohai? Nka n'iwe oinai ebigambo by'oburora obutalihwaho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.68",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.68"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "69",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:69"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "69",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwe twaikiliize, twamanyire okwo oli Mutakatifu wa Ruhanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.69",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.69"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "70",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:70"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "70",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu abahorora ati, “Inywe eikumi na babili t'inye nabaronzire? Kyonkai omuli inywe omoi ni sitani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.70",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.70"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "71",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 6:71"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "71",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba nagamba Yuda eya Simoni Isikariote, omoi omu 12 ayabaire naija kumubanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.6.71",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.6.71"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
